        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Quicklime, milled, packed, at plant
Packed lime products do all use the module "packing, lime products";
CAS number: 001305-62-0; 
Formula: CaO; 
Synonyms: burnt, caustic, quick, lime, Calciumhydroxid, Calcium hydroxide; 
UUID: f0199e27-6562-3ac9-bfb6-d161a98e5b12
includes the packing and one part of the total heating energy for "production" and "administration
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: The company KFN works on a technically high level.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 150'000t
Sampling: survey 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
